window.products.push({"id":756004,"name":"Queen's China Toile de Jouy Blue 20-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHYNTXGQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This Blue Toile de Jouy collection features drawings & reproductions from many of England's Historic Royal Palaces during the period of Royal inhabitancy. This Toile de Jouy is coloured in delicate powder blue & warm cream giving a subtle yet stylish appeal. Our Artisans & Artists have been able to recreate the appeal of this historic Toile heritage by faithfully reproducing the design onto engravings from where we can reproduce these designs utilising the transfer print process. This historical collection with contemporary living appeal will ensure years of delight during its many years of constant use. The 20 Piece dinner set is sure to turn heads. Amazon.com This Queens China Toile de Jouy 20-piece dinnerware set has an understated beauty that makes for a peaceful, tasteful table. A muted blue, the orderly but organic pattern features detailed birds, branches, flowers, leaves, and insects on the wing. It is a warm and elegant design, made richer by a very subtle stitch pattern on the creamy background. The bowls bear a quaint image of a gardener at work, and the teacups feature two sweet butterflies inside the rim. Some pieces have fine but ornate borders in tan. Crafted from high-fired earthenware, Toile de Jouy dishes feature a durable top glaze to protect the transfer-printed pattern. They are safe in the microwave and dishwasher and intended for comfortable, frequent use. This set includes place settings for four, each with a 10-3/4-inch rimmed dinner plate, an 8-1/2-inch salad plate, a 9-inch rimmed bowl, a 6-1/4-inch saucer, and a 3-3/4-inch-diameter teacup. Queens China also makes Toile de Jouy in cranberry. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-3/4-inch rimmed dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch salad plate; 9-inch rimmed bowl; 6-1/4-inch saucer; 3-3/4-inch-diameter teacup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHYNTXGQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Queen's China","source_asin":"B0000C861Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C861Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C861Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
