window.products.push({"id":756061,"name":"HENGYANG Over The Toilet Storage, 3-Tier Wooden Bathroom Shelf Over Toilet with 2 Hooks & Toilet Paper Holder, 20 inch Over Toilet Shelf Organizer for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOvuLf7AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡【EVERY INCH PRECIOUS】💡 This over the toilet storage rack, is a perfect pick for bathrooms. It features 3 open shelves, 1 aluminum toilet paper holder and 2 multi-purpose solid copper hooks to provide more space, helps you to store bath essentials, like Towels, Roll paper, Candles, Shampoo and Soaps. 🚿【GIVE YOU GOOD ENJOYMENT】🚿 Made of 100% Solid Wood designed to last, safer and more environmentally friendly than metal. Partition with a gap leaves no water, moisture-proof and humidity-proof. As a gift, the Allen Wrench is a good helper to install and remove over the toilet storage shelf. Wood-colored plastic screw cap blocking screw holes, which makes it sturdy, waterproof and do not worry about affecting the beauty. The bathroom space saver with smooth finish, can well protect you from being scratched, attractive appearance also adds a sense of nature to your bathroom. 🚽【FIT FOR YOUR TOILET】🚽 Over the toilet shelf provides 4 adjustable feet to keep stable and protect the ground from scratches. And each partition is equipped with a wooden cylindrical guardrail to prevent your supplies toppling. Overall sizes is 19.6\"L*9.5\"W*59.8\"H. The toilet shelf organizer is fits 19, 20 inch wide toilets, and easily fits into space behind your toilet. 🛀【MULTIFUNCTIONAL BATHROOM STORAGE SHELF】🛀 There are THREE OPEN SHELVES, place daily things at eye level for taking at wills. Bathroom organizer over toilet can be used as storage cabinet, kitchen rack, plant stand. Enjoy the fun of DIY, you can place it in multiple scenes, like the living room, entryway, kitchen, balcony, porch. 🧰【EASY TO ASSEMBLE】🧰 No more making yourself dizzy among because it's easy to install this toilet rack. All screws are only one size, use the provided tools and detailed instructions, you can have it in less than half an hour quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOvuLf7AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENGYANG","source_asin":"B0BHNTNKRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHNTNKRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHNTNKRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
