window.products.push({"id":756171,"name":"Chef's Star 14 Piece Stackable, Microwavable Food Storage Containers with Leak-proof Locking Lids—PBA Free| 1 x 7L (237 oz.), 2 x 1.4L (48 oz.), 4 x 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lJpRWHqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chef’s Star Better Food Storage and Better Organization Chef’s Star BPA Free Microwavable Food Storage Containers snap together to the bottom of containers to keep your cabinets, refrigerator, freezer, and closet organized. The square shape food storage container maximizes storage capacity while minimizing space. Made of the highest quality food safe materials, these containers and lids withstand a range of temperatures, making them completely microwave or freezer safe. Top rack dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. Note also that thanks to their stackable, space-saving design, these containers fit into one big container for easy and convenient storage.With these reusable, super practical lunch boxes you can always enjoy healthy, meals everywhere. Pack a fresh salad, fruits, or any dry snack in this ultimate food container; for adults or kids; perfect for work or school, just put it in your lunch bag, backpack, gym bag or handbag. Classify any clothing, craft, hardware, accessories etc. Easy to find what you want and never need to ransack your closet. These storage boxes organizer set provides attractive, lightweight solution for many personal storage needs. A variety of formats are available to fit your needs. This collection is perfect for closets, nurseries, bedrooms, dorms, garages, anywhere in the home or office. Organize Small Parts For Home, Office, And Garage Organize and protect components with a variety of containers configurations that provide versatile storage solutions for home, garage and office settings. Clear, strong containers offer easy content identification with a great feature of snap-lock latches to keep out moisture, humidity and prevent contents from spilling. Whatever the use, the fourteen piece set allows for easy storage, organization, on-the-go outings!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lJpRWHqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef's Star","source_asin":"B06XNXFGKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XNXFGKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XNXFGKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
