window.products.push({"id":756184,"name":"S4Sassy Multicolor Home Decor Mughal Print Square Cushion Cover Pillow Case Throw -12 x 12 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bj+mpnfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤ DESIGN: Mughal Printed Cushion Cover. ✤ MATERIAL: We offer 2 Fabric option in these cushion covers - One is Heavy Satin and Other in Canvas. Both the materials are durable and comfortable. You can choose any material of your choice from the given drop-down option. ✤ SIZE: We offer lots of Size options. You can Choose the required size from your given size options. (please allow 1-2 cm deviation ,as they are handmade) ✤ PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 Pillow Cover | Attention: pillow case only, the Filling/ Insert not included. ✤ COLOR: MultiCOLOR ✤ CLOSURE: These cushion covers come with high quality invisible zipper, which is smooth and durable. ➽ P.S.: Printed on one side. Back side of the cushion cover in plain white. ✤ S4Sassy cushion covers are available in 2 type of quality fabric i.e Satin and Canvas. Both the fabrics are durable and comfortable, perfect for home and decoration purpose. We have tried to show the fabric texture and look in one of the image. ✤ Below are the details and fabric content for both the types of fabric. ✤ SATIN (heavy) : 260 GSM - Heavy-weight white smooth satin fabric, with a high sheen and a soft hand. It has crisp bright colors and holds up well through repeated laundering. ✤ CANVAS (Polyester) : 300 GSM - Has a heavy weight tight weave, but is soft, flexible with prints quite vibrant. This fabric is an excellent choice for outdoor furniture as they are much more durable and hard wearing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bj+mpnfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S4Sassy","source_asin":"B077XXFDTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077XXFDTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077XXFDTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
