window.products.push({"id":756223,"name":"Fall Table Runner Thanksgiving Decorations 13 x 72 Inch Maple Leaves Table Runner Fall Decor Harvest Lace Pumpkin Runner Brow Long Fall Table Line Fal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dHbNwJx5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lace 【Exclusive Seamless Design 】This Lace Maple Leaf Runner is a beautiful seamless one piece design.Made of 100% fabric polyester, Lace knitted craft with a maple leaf pattern, sewing on the edge with the soldering iron, exquisite edges, not easily loose thread.Decorate on its own or over a tablecloth. Use any color fabric under the lace to create a different effect(Liner not included) 【Perfect Size for Your Table】:This long table runner measures 13x 72 inch in size, Appropriate for a table that can seat 4-6 people. Update your home decor with this attractive Fall Table Linen,Anti-Crease and stain resistant this is a great option for serving food and setting the mood of your meal.Harvest Table decoration with attractive lace Luxury designs will add a fresh feeling for any table. 【Fall Thanksgiving Decoration】With autumn symbols: maple leaves and pumpkins This versatile decoration is perfect for use in Thanksgiving , weddings, engagement parties, birthdays, festive occasions everyday dining table decoration and more! This table runner is a classic and cheap fall home decoration.Perfect fall Thanksgiving day table decorations 【Enhance Your Life】:Dress up any table top for your Thanksgiving holiday with this beautiful maple leaves table runner or pumpkin table Linen to add a luxurious feel to your special events with these lace table runners. This versatile decoration is perfect for use in Thanksgiving , weddings, engagement parties, birthdays, festive occasions everyday dining table decoration and more! Spice up your home to add glamour and ambience . Bring a fun, creative, long lasting piece to your life. [ Easy care ] Machine or hand washable, easy to care, warm iron if needed. Not easy to fade and loose thread, the color is firm. Easy to be folded up and to store for reuse. Simply decorate with these fireplace scarf and Fall table runner, they will easily add a Autumn festival atmosphere for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dHbNwJx5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camlinbo","source_asin":"B07SJKNR9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SJKNR9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SJKNR9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":756224,"name":"Portmeirion Sophie Conran White Small Oval Platter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NcnlNCd0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Sophie Conran Collection was designed exclusively for Portmeirion. This collection is as durable and functional as it is beautiful. Sophie is part of the world-famous Conran lifestyle and culinary dynasty. The simplistic and organic nature of this collection makes it perfect for every style and taste. Each beautifully delicate item meets the hard-wearing needs of today's family and culinary experts. Available in White, Bisque and Celadon, the look can be as simple or diverse as your tastes demand. Amazon.com This simple, beautiful, and functional platter is part of an entire tableware collection designed by Sophie Conran, an English food writer with her own gourmet pie company. Conran infuses her namesake tableware with a flowing organic nature and tactile expression, as evidenced by the ridges and dipped rims that recall handcrafted pottery. Made of porcelain expressly for Portmeirion, the collection comes in white with select pieces available in cool blue celadon and a creamy biscuit color. Measuring 11-1/2 by 8-1/2 inches, this oval platter is the smallest of three sizes. With its slightly wavy and uneven rim, giving it a rustic yet modern appeal, the platter compellingly serves up roasted vegetables, potatoes, sweets, and more. Safe for use in the oven or microwave, and even the freezer, the durable yet lightweight dish can go hot right to the table, and after use, scrubs clean by hand or slips into the dishwasher. The platter makes a great gift for the home cook who appreciates life's simple pleasures. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NcnlNCd0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B079MFVWQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MFVWQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MFVWQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
