window.products.push({"id":756296,"name":"1.5L/3L/5L/10L Vintage Wood Oak Timber Wine Barrel Dispenser for Beer Brandy Tequila Whiskey Rum Port (Upright 10L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+dqiaXQUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Note: only stand upright, not lying down specification: Packing size: 25.00 x 25.00 x 36.00cm Package weight: 1.80kg Capacity: 10L Wooden barrel material: pine Features: 1. Sterile aluminum foil lining 2. All wooden wine barrels are pressure tested for leaks. Tips: 1. Don't shake the wine barrel 2. Do not use hard objects in a mixing barrel. 3. When using for the first time, please wash the bucket with water and then rinse with wine 4. Pine barrels cannot be filled with beer, gas, liquid, etc. 5. If you want to brew some wine, it is recommended to use non-Daniel pine barrels, our products do not have the function of aging wine. Note: 1. Due to manual measurement, please allow an error of 1-3mm. 2. With different colors, the display may be different, please understand. 3. Barrels are not used for aging wine or liquor, but only for storing liquid. The outside of the barrel is wooden, and the wood is only used for decoration, and the inner tank has a food-grade aluminum foil bag. Wood is not waterproof. Bucket maintenance: 1. The wood used in the barrel is dry wood, so it is forbidden to soak it in water. When wiping, the towel should not be too wet. 2. In the summer high temperature, the added wine or liquid should not be too full to prevent the alcohol or other liquid from overflowing due to the rise of heat. Packing list: Wine barrel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+dqiaXQUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eapmic","source_asin":"B0842H14PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842H14PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842H14PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
