window.products.push({"id":756364,"name":"Rose Ice Cube Mold, Heart Shape Ice Cube Tray, Fun Silicone Ice Mold with Clear Funnel-type Lid, 3 Heart & 3 Rose Shape Ice Balls for Chilling Whiskey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rhSWwgNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Rose & Heart Ice Balls - The Ice Tray Mold makes 3 rose & 3 heart ice balls at once. The diameter of each ice ball is about 1.7 inch. Designed wonderfully with the shape of rose and heart, realistic-looking flower and heart shaped ice cube create a romantic atmosphere for your party. Perfect for garnishing your whiskey with frozen rose and heart ice balls to make a lavish drink. Safe and Reliable Silicone Ice Tray - Our ice cube trays are made of premium quality food grade silicone and are BPA free. You can use our ice trays with confidence. Freezer, microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. Size of the ice cube tray: 6.6x4.6x1.8 inch. Funnel-type Lid, Easy to Use - The built-in funnel is designed to be integrated with the lid, it is convenient for you to fill water without other tools. And the transparent lid allows you to see water level and avoid over-filling. Easy to Release, Leak-proof Design - The upgraded silicone ice mold has 6 additional locators and raised edge grooves between the base and lid to prevent water leakage. The plating process is used on the inner surface of the ice cube mold to make the ice balls easier to release. Before putting items in the refrigerator, make sure you have pressed the buckles. Multipurpose Shaped Ice Tray - You can make heart & rose ice cubes with our silicone ice tray, perfect for cooling your whiskey, cocktails, bourbon, ice coffee, juice, mint-infused mojitos or frozen lemonade. You can also make heart & rose chocolate, little ice lollies, pudding, fruit jelly, yogurt, ice cream, candy, etc. Even rose and heart soap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rhSWwgNuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IDVVSSX","source_asin":"B0BPGW71HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPGW71HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPGW71HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
