window.products.push({"id":756748,"name":"OMMO Electric Milk Frother, 4-in-1 Milk Frother and Steamer 400ml/14.1oz Large Capacity Hot and Cold Foam Maker and Milk Warmer for Coffee/Milk, Anti-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NqLainNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ 【4 in 1 Multifunctional】-- This electric milk frother has a captivating frothing function, one button for 3 settings, can make 4 different flavors of milk foam: warm dense foam, hot airy foam, hot milk and cold froth, you can DIY your coffee drinks, such as coffee, latte, cappuccino, macchiatos etc., our electric milk steamer is really a good helper in your kitchen. ☕ 【Get Foam Quietly within 2 Mins】-- Our milk frother and steamer is noiseless when it works, won't disturb your family's sleep; You can enjoy creating exquisit hot or cold milk froth in less than 2 mins. It is recommended to use whole milk (Fat content>3%) for better result, if not, the foam will not be thick enough. ☕【Unique Whisk Design】-- Choose the right whisk according to your needs, the whisk with spring is used for foaming and mixing, the whisk without spring is only used for mixing/heating; Small spring coil are easy to lose, by detachable design, the spring coil can be removed separately for cleaning easy, and then embedded in the transparent cover of the milk frother machine. ☕ 【Capacity and Temperature】-- There are two scales on the inner wall, the max level of heating milk(400ml/14.1oz) and the max level of milk foaming(150ml/5.3oz), when you choose the frothing function, please make sure the milk is below the frothing milk MAX line (not the top heating MAX line) to prevent overflow. When it heated to 65°C/149°F in 2 minutes, it will automatically power off and stop heating, which can effectively prevent machine damage caused by overheating. ☕【Durable and Stylish Design】-- High-quality stainless steel and non-stick coating interior makes your milk froth maker healthy, anti-scald, and easy cleaning; 360° rotatable&detachable base and anti-slip feet pad make placement more stable, also keep the wires away from water; with the comfortable handle, it is very suitable for your kitchen counter, you can make a cup of frothy and delicious coffee, latte, hot chocolate or cappuccino at home easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NqLainNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMMO","source_asin":"B09QCNJ7RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QCNJ7RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QCNJ7RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
