window.products.push({"id":756782,"name":"IsBuho Framed Boho Wall Art Set of 3, Minimalist Canvas Wall Art Mid Century Modern Prints, Geometric Abstract Wall Decor for Living Room, Bedroom, Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NiEcXVK5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Framed Boho Wall Art] The size of the boho wall art is:12x16 inches (30x40cm x 3pcs). It depicts the boho style sunrise, midday, and sunset, implying bright, full of hope, and good fortune. Our boho wall art will add the perfect sense of detail and bring a new look to your home. [Durable & Waterproof Canvas Wall Art] The mid-century wall art using selected high-quality pine wood frame and waterproof canvas with greatest color performance. The canvas is moisture-proof and stable, we adopts anti-fading environmentally friendly ink, which will not fade over time. [Ready to Hang] The boho wall art is easy for you to hang it on the wall, we provide a hanging kit with non-trace nails, which is easy to use and can perfectly protect your wall. Each canvas painting is carefully packaged in opp bags and box to make sure they are intact. [Perfect Home Decoration and Heartwarming Gift] The modern natural room art can easily mix and match with any home decor style. It is also a great gift for your relatives, friends and colleagues for Christmas, Wedding, Birthday, Thanksgiving or Valentine's Day, etc. [Customer Service] We are committed to create top-notch products to guarantee your satisfaction, if you have any questions or concerns about our canvas artwork, please email us, we are here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NiEcXVK5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IsBuho","source_asin":"B0BDYZ14DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDYZ14DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDYZ14DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":756783,"name":"Deluxe Comfort Bed Pillow, 24\" x 22\" x 14\", White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hz8TkJGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So you plan to spend a relaxing day off in bed, reading or watching television. Or perhaps you have just completed a long day's work, and are looking forward to a smooth, rejuvenating night's rest. Maybe you are currently dealing with an illness or condition that requires a period of elongated bed rest. Yet your pillow, generally considered a comfort aid, is fighting you every step of the way! It slips. It slides. When you try to pile several of these typical‘pillows bed' pillows on top of one another, they scatter or flatten. It looks as if your much anticipated rest or de-stress session is bound to be anything but. Ah, but there is a solution-and in the form of the Bed Wedge Support Pillow White from Deluxe Comfort. This unique and exemplary wedge shaped pillow can be many pillows to many people. A wedge pillow medical, this soft aid serves many people dealing with short- and long-term ailments and conditions. It can act as an reflux wedge pillow or gerd pillow, one that elevates your torso so that your acid does not reach your esophagus. It's the perfect back pillow for bed, the rare pillow that cushions and supports the back along with the head and neck-helping to ease and relieve pain in all three areas. It can serve as an anti snoring pillow, and even facilitates breathing by opening airways. It can serve as a mastectomy pillow, pregnancy wedge pillow, and a wedge pillow. This stellar example of wedge pillows for bed even improves blood circulation! This luxurious triangle pillow also comes in handy when you need a good night's sleep. These wedge pillows for sleeping are whisper soft, offering a memory foam wedge that cradles, comforts, and even shifts to adhere to the contours of the body. The pillow equivalent to a sleep number bed, this long triangular foam wedge pillow is like a bed in itself-one that even comes covered with padded, machine washable covers. Versatility and flexibility are additional features of the Bed Wedge Support Pillow White. Want to read the day away in comfort? This is the ideal bed wedge for reading, as it inclines and supports the head and neck to bring your books and magazines to eye level-whenever you wish to enjoy the benefits of reading in the luxury of your own bed. It also serves as the ideal TV pillow, or a great prop up pillow if you wish to eat, talk on the phone, write, or play video games in bed. No doubt about it; the Bed Wedge Support Pillow White is a pillow for all purposes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hz8TkJGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Comfort","source_asin":"B0773LPXBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0773LPXBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0773LPXBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
