window.products.push({"id":756817,"name":"100% Egyptian Cotton Fitted Sheet Queen Size White, 600 Thread Count, Bed Fitted Sheet Only, 16\" Deep Pocket Sheet, Soft & Elastic Sateen Weave Bottom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LQ1RRRwgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY EGYPTIAN COTTON SHEETS QUEEN - Our 600 thread count queen fitted sheet is made with 100% long staple cotton fiber and a gorgeous sateen weave. That makes this white fitted sheet to be more durable , softer and breathable. Meantime, sateen sheets offer you silky feel and keep you relax & cozy. Lie down on this 600-thread-count pure white fitted sheet and enjoy the perfect sleeping experience with your family. You and your family deserves the best. 1 PIECE QUEEN FITTED SHEET ONLY (NOT A SET) - Queen Size Fitted Sheet measures 60\" W x 80\" L + 16\" Deep pocket (152cm x 203cm + 41cm). Our fitted sheets are available in several classic colors (Pure White & Light Grey) and features smart foot tag to indicate the width side of the fitted sheet for ease of use. Upgrade your living place with this luxury fitted sheet now, this cozy, skin-friendly bedsheet is just what you need for a relaxing sleep. Best Choice for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room and kids' room. Also ideal gift idea for Moms and Dads, Friends,Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. DEEP POCKET FOR A PERFECT SNUG FIT - This 16\" deep pocket white queen size fitted sheet has super strong elastic fabric that helps them fit snugly on both tall and low profile memory foam mattresses or pillowtop mattresses. No more worrying about your sheets popping off in the middle of the night! They also stay in place better than regular sheets, so you can sleep soundly without worrying about them bunching up. STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX CERTIFICATION - From the fabric to the thread and accessories, our fitted sheets have been scientifically tested. We promise that these fitted sheets are safer choice for your health and preferred material for kids and anyone with sensitive skin. And no need worry about pilling, shrinkage,wrinkle and color fading issue, please refer to the care guidence below. CARE GUIDENCE & 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Machine wash our 100% egyptian cotton fitted sheets in warm water and lowest heat in the dryer, do not bleach. To keep the fitted sheet wrinkle-free and off-shrinkage, please take it out of the dryer before completely dry. And cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness. If for any reason you don't love our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LQ1RRRwgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zaizaihome","source_asin":"B0BNDH3JMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-756817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNDH3JMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNDH3JMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
